# Wayward Soul Release Notes

## 0.0.1 (07 Apr 2026)

* Initial release

## 1.5.1 (08 Apr 2026)

* Added initial dialogue for prologue
* Added all initial title screen functions

## 1.5.3 (09 Apr 2026)

* Added ability to save/load files
* Added save data management to config menu
* Added credits to config menu
* Added software info to config menu
* Added title screen art
* Added check for save data version
* Updated save data version to 1.0
* Various bug fixes and optimizations

## 1.5.4 (10 Apr 2026)

* Added procedure to update save file to correct version
* Added error prompt when attempting to load a file with a version mismatch